@startuml observations
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title New recipient-local observation contract
component "Actual game + causal journal\ncontinuing recipient producer" as HOST <<app>>
component "Recipient JSON text\nbounded before parsing" as JSON <<app>>
component "Zod strict shape + inferred types" as SHAPE <<app>>
component "Visibility / identity / economic invariants" as DOMAIN <<app>>
component "Readonly recipient observation" as DTO <<app>>
component "JSON Schema 2020-12\nshape only" as SCHEMA <<app>>
HOST --> JSON : recipient projection only
JSON --> SHAPE : JSON.parse
SHAPE --> DOMAIN : typed bounded fields
DOMAIN --> DTO : validated own state + sightings + ledger
SHAPE --> SCHEMA : Zod native conversion
note bottom of DTO
  No V2 byte compatibility or custom canonical serializer.
  A valid DTO does not authenticate the producer.
  Supervised native/reference runtime remains pending.
end note
@enduml
